            "review_title": "Review at Che Thai Na Na",
            "review_text": "Yeh K\n2 contributions\n0\nNice cold dessert on a warm sunny day\nJan 2025 • Couples\nOff the main road, a shop along a smaller alley, this shop offers a variety of desserts. They must have sold out and near closing times because when we arrived they only had a few choices left. Fortunately the dessert I was yearning for was available -- Tau Hu Sau Rieng -- a cold dessert with pandan jelly and durian on top! Cost VND20,000. Will surely come back next time to try other items on the menu.\nRead more\nWritten January 25, 2025",
